<title>NETHERLANDS: Unisource 1996 turnover 2.4 bln guilders.</title>
<headline>Unisource 1996 turnover 2.4 bln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisource, the telecoms joint venture between Dutch PTT, Sweden's Telia, Swiss Telecom PTT and Spain's Telefonica, reported 1996 turnover of 2.4 billion guilders.</p>
<p>Last June the company announced a net loss of 320 million guilders in 1995 with turnover of 1.316 billion guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 500</p>
</text>
